{"4689150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "From The Top: Chimera Overdrive", "steam_appid": 4689150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/extras/464fba1b4ac510a7ea4c339cedc1a6b1.poster.avif?t=1786718335\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/extras/464fba1b4ac510a7ea4c339cedc1a6b1.webm?t=1786718335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/extras/464fba1b4ac510a7ea4c339cedc1a6b1.mp4?t=1786718335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From The Top: Chimera Overdrive </strong>is a <strong>Y2K </strong>Action <strong>Roguelike</strong> where you fight through <strong>Battling Top Tournament</strong> to (eventually) <strong>buy</strong> yourself a <strong>house</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also begrudgingly a <strong>sequel</strong>! cause it's grungy like that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/extras/a37043d380459bb056ae3b3d54c11829.poster.avif?t=1786718335\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/extras/a37043d380459bb056ae3b3d54c11829.webm?t=1786718335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/extras/a37043d380459bb056ae3b3d54c11829.mp4?t=1786718335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The definitive Battling top experience!</strong> : Watch the most exciting physics simulation runs its course! Win by outlasting, knocking-out, or by just hitting them really really hard!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Constant action:</strong> </i> <strong>3, 2, 1, DRIVE!</strong> Don't blink or you'll miss it! Use parts and ability to alter the outcome of a fight! Don't lose your cool or focus, no fight is over until the bell is rang. Victory (or defeat) is always around the corner<strong>!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/extras/d69f1a52ae4da5df0955a88175709995.poster.avif?t=1786718335\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/extras/d69f1a52ae4da5df0955a88175709995.webm?t=1786718335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/extras/d69f1a52ae4da5df0955a88175709995.mp4?t=1786718335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>We start From the Top!:</strong></i> Fight through ever competitive and ever changing Overdrive League! Not one tournament run is the same! Every run you'll fight <strong>Different Enemies</strong> and obtain <strong>Different Parts</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Build the perfect Chimera:</strong> </i> <strong>Collect</strong> new parts and <strong>Combine</strong> them together to create the <strong>Perfect Chimera Drive.</strong> Chimera together different parts  -not just to adapt- but Thrive!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/extras/99d0d5182ca82bb1e7f69d3badae1ad2.poster.avif?t=1786718335\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/extras/99d0d5182ca82bb1e7f69d3badae1ad2.webm?t=1786718335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/extras/99d0d5182ca82bb1e7f69d3badae1ad2.mp4?t=1786718335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Buy a house!</strong></i><strong>:</strong> It's not just about being the best out here! Discover and earn your way through the world of Chimera Overdrive! Fight harder and harder opponent to make <strong>New Friends</strong>, <strong>Earn Money, </strong>and eventually -the hardest achievement of all- <strong>Buying a house!</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>MULTIPLAYER :</strong></i> Want to proof that you're really the best??? <strong>Invite your friend over</strong> for some Chimera Overdrive and have a <strong>REAL</strong> Battling top <strong>Tournament</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/extras/464fba1b4ac510a7ea4c339cedc1a6b1.poster.avif?t=1786718335\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/extras/464fba1b4ac510a7ea4c339cedc1a6b1.webm?t=1786718335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/extras/464fba1b4ac510a7ea4c339cedc1a6b1.mp4?t=1786718335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </st