f all- <strong>Buying a house!</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>MULTIPLAYER :</strong></i> Want to proof that you're really the best??? <strong>Invite your friend over</strong> for some Chimera Overdrive and have a <strong>REAL</strong> Battling top <strong>Tournament</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Y2K Action Roguelike where you fight through battling top tournament to (eventually) buy yourself a house. Collect new parts, Chimera together spinning tops and Overdrive to victory, starting From The Top!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/9d5a5bd04403c41d69c0f2ee4c7ea91f76facbbe/header.jpg?t=1786718335", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/5ac64b38ef55ba90828484a358bb5af64df49daa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786718335", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689150/5ac64b38ef55ba90828484a358bb5af64df49daa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786718335", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Literally anything<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Anything literally<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Apple Silicon or Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB ava